<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108947" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποπίνω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drink a little, drink moderately,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηκέθ᾽ οὕτω . . Σκυθικὴν πόσιν . .
					μελετῶμεν, ἀλλὰ καλοῖς ὑποπίνοντες ἐν ὕμνοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anacr.
					63.11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποπεπώκαμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					496
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετρίως ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					372d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐχθὲς ὑπέπινες, εἶτα νυνὶ κραιπαλᾷς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					286
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				271
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>drink at dessert,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				494
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				153.5
			</span></i> (hex.), <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.4.9
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποπεπωκώς</span>”
				<i>rather tipsy,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					874
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lys.</u>
				395
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.3.29
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
